@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Healthcheck API Gateway
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/health

###

### 2. Xem sản phẩm qua Gateway (Public Route)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/products

###

### 3a. Đăng ký tài khoản mới qua Gateway
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sang",
  "password": "password123",
  "fullname": "Trần Văn Sang",
  "email": "sang@example.com",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

###

### 3b. Đăng nhập Auth Service qua Gateway để lấy Token
# @name loginRequest
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sang",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 4. Xem chi tiết Đơn hàng theo ID qua Gateway
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/orders/c1051471-b46e-4bec-b36d-0740c5d4c202
Authorization: Bearer {{loginRequest.response.body.token}}

### 5. Xem thông tin Vận đơn qua Gateway (Cần Token)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginRequest.response.body.token}}


### Health Check API Gateway
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Health Check Auth Service (via Gateway Proxy)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/health

### Health Check Customer Service (via Gateway Proxy)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/customers/health

### Health Check Product Service (via Gateway Proxy)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/health

### Health Check Order Service (via Gateway Proxy)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/health

### Health Check Shipment Service (via Gateway Proxy)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/shipments/health 


### ==========================================
### BƯỚC 21: LUỒNG KIỂM THỬ CHÍNH (HAPPY PATH)
### ==========================================

### 1. Đăng ký tài khoản (Register)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser2030",
  "email": "testuser2030@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullname": "Trần Văn Sang",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 2. Đăng nhập lấy JWT Token (Login)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser2030",
  "password": "Password123!"
}
### 2b. Lấy thông tin Khách hàng (Đã tự động tạo khi Register)
# @name getCustomer
GET http://localhost:3000/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### Biến lưu tự động Token từ response login
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Tạo sản phẩm mới (Product Service)
# @name createProduct
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Laptop Alienware m15",
  "sku": "ALIENWARE-M15-2026",
  "price": 25000000,
  "stock": 10
}


### 4. Tạo đơn hàng (Order Service -> Kafka Event)
# @name createOrder
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "customerId": "3acf3518-0447-4ea0-be00-89f87c152d03",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "6ad704de682d748526eb615f",
      "quantity": 2,
      "price": 25000000
    }
  ]
}

### 5. Tra cứu Vận đơn tự động sinh ra (Shipment Service)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/shipments/order/e3f51475-0087-47e9-99b9-7ed6f27cbe2c
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Mục 4. TC-PRO-01: Lấy danh sách sản phẩm (Product Service)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

